  "details": "If a user tries to search for specific events that are occurring soon (such as \"Game Night\" or \"Karaoke Night\"), there is currently no means to do so outside of scrolling through the \"Live Now\" tab and hoping to stumble upon one. \n\nIf one attempts to use the search tab, they will more often than not end up with results for recurring events far in the future -- pushing out the visibility for both their own group's closest version of said event, and for other groups who may only have one-time events happening soon.\n\nIs it possible to add a sort function by event date in the search results?",
